EN:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}! Perfect timing!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}If you're seeing {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} today,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}could you deliver something to {{TAG:000E:0007:0600680069006D000600680065007200}}
for me?
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It's this thing I borrowed when I was
over at {{TAG:000E:0007:06006800690073000600680065007200}} house the other day,
but I don't need it anymore.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} senden küçük bir iyilik
isteyebilir miyim?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}
Aslında, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}bu daha çok {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}} için bir iyilik;
{{TAG:000E:0007:0400680065000600730068006500}} dışarıdayken bir şey almamı istemişti.
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Bunu gizlice teslim edebilir misin?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ne de olsa,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}'ın mahremiyetini de
düşünmek gerek.

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¿De verdad te haces cargo del
asunto, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Genial, tómalo.{{TAG:0003:000D:}}
Sobra decirlo, ¡pero no lo pierdas!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}C'est vrai, t'acceptes, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} ?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Parfait, alors je te confie ça.{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Prends-en bien soin !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Sicher, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Also gut, dann
